From 1992 to 1994, the {{ill|Tokyo Metropolitan Government Board of Education|ja|東京都教育委員会|12=draft}} carried out a survey of kofun in the Tama region, and Tenmondai Kōnai Kofun was first introduced to the academic community in their report.

