'''Tenmondai Kōnai Kofun''' (天文台構内古墳) is a [[:en:Kofun|Kofun]] located in the {{ill|National Astronomical Observatory of Japan|ja|国立天文台三鷹キャンパス|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/National Astronomical Observatory of Japan|qq=}} premises in [[:en:Mitaka, Tokyo|Mitaka, Tokyo]], [[:en:Tokyo|Tokyo]]. Its type is a {{ill|Jōen-kahō-fun|ja|上円下方墳|1=Joenkahofun|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Jōen-kahō-fun|13=User:Immanuelle/Joenkahofun|qq=|comment=enwiki is a redirect}}, but it has not been Historic Site1 as a historic site.

